    "sells": "<p>Turnkey robot cells and lines; feasibility studies and test picks; mechanical, electrical, and safety design; PLC, HMI (the operator touch screen), and robot programming; installation and commissioning; operator and maintenance training; service contracts and upgrades.</p>",
