    "companies": "<ul><li><strong>Toyota Automated Logistics</strong> — warehouse automation integrator formed April 1, 2026 from Bastian Solutions, Vanderlande's warehousing business, and viastore; a Toyota Industries business, judging by its site's link to Toyota Industries Corporation <sup class=\"cite\">[3]</sup>.</li><li><strong>ATS Corporation</strong> — automation company listed on the Toronto and New York stock exchanges, serving life sciences, food and beverage, transportation, consumer products, and energy <sup class=\"cite\">[4]</sup>.</li><li><strong>JR Automation</strong> — automated manufacturing and robotic system integrator, acquired by Hitachi in 2019 <sup class=\"cite\">[7]</sup>.</li><li><strong>CKC Automation and Aslin Automation</strong> (California) — examples of small local FANUC Authorized System Integrators <sup class=\"cite\">[1]</sup>.</li></ul>"
