    "companies": "<ul><li><strong>Chef Robotics</strong> (US) — food-assembly robots under RaaS; named customers include Taylor Farms, gategroup, Amy's Kitchen, and CookUnity <sup class=\"cite\">[1]</sup>.</li><li><strong>Symbotic</strong> (US) — warehouse automation for Walmart, Target, Albertsons, C&amp;S Wholesale Grocers, and others <sup class=\"cite\">[4]</sup>; went public through a merger, announced in December 2021, with a SoftBank-sponsored acquisition company <sup class=\"cite\">[2]</sup>.</li><li><strong>Robotiq</strong> — sells grippers and sensors, and also palletizing, machine-tending, and screwdriving workcells <sup class=\"cite\">[3]</sup>.</li></ul>"
